+
+## Local AI Office integration (2026-10-15)
+
+`apps/ai-office-preview` exposes DOCX layout, rasterization, caret/selection state, the engine registry (excluding host-owned file operations) and save bytes through WebAssembly. The `ai-office` feature in `apps/wordcraft-web` embeds the full web ribbon, dialogs and canvas in the sibling VS Code fork, with a bounded request/event bridge for commands, file pickers, clipboard text, versioned saves and recovery snapshots. The host pauses edits while writing a save and acknowledges success or failure. Synthetic export/reopen tests cover document editing, while host tests cover save failure, recovery and external conflicts. The embedded UI also passed command/edit/undo/redo and repeated-save smoke checks. The embedded document defaults to Page Width; narrow panes use overflow tab/action menus, a compact status bar and a bounded search control. Desktop-only integrations and upstream editing parity estimates are unchanged.
